OL,3,AChild's hidden letter found after 44
OL,4,Ayears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA letter written by a 10-year-old girl
OL,7,Fin the 1980s and hidden in the cavity
OL,8,Fof the stairs at her home has been
OL,9,Ffound 44 years later.
OL,11,FThe house in Hockley, Essex, was
OL,12,Fundergoing renovation work when a
OL,13,Fworker found the scrap of paper and
OL,14,Fpassed it to Michelle Harwood, who now
OL,15,Flives there.
OL,17,FFilled with curiosity, the 36-year-old
OL,18,Fcharity worker examined it - noting
OL,19,F"really neat" handwriting for a child -
OL,20,Fand posted on her local Facebook
OL,21,Fcommunity group on Thursday morning to
OL,22,Ftrack down the author.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
